/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 72 0 R
/T (In modern workshops, technicians and engineers often need to move back and forth between different benches or tool racks to collect small tools, fasteners, and measuring instruments. While this may seem like a minor task, over the course of a workday, these repeated movements add up and create significant inefficiencies. The wasted time and physical strain not only slow down the work process but also reduce concentration and productivity.)
/E (In modern workshops, technicians and engineers often need to move back and forth between different benches or tool racks to collect small tools, fasteners, and measuring instruments. While this may seem like a minor task, over the course of a workday, these repeated movements add up and create significant inefficiencies. The wasted time and physical strain not only slow down the work process but also reduce concentration and productivity.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
